message: "If you use these data or this reanalysis, please cite the original paper (below) and this archive."
title: "etn-sar: data and reanalysis for Jessee, Stout & McMeen (2022), species-area relationships of amphibians and reptiles in Eastern Tennessee"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jessee
    given-names: Lance D.
