abstract: >-
  Data and analyses from Jessee, Stout & McMeen (2022): the herpetofaunal
  inventory of Steele Creek Park and species-area relationships for
  amphibians and reptiles across four nested areas in Eastern Tennessee,
  reproduced with the original log-linear regression and refit by nonlinear
  least squares with the sars Python package.
